-=====================================
-
-Service		org.bluez
-Interface	org.bluez.SerialProxy
-Object path	[variable prefix]/{hci0,hci1,...}/{proxy0,proxy1,...}
-
-Methods		void Enable()
-
-			Starts to listen to the TTY or Unix socket, allocates
